{
  "id": "ECC.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Ecclesiastes 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is an evil which I have seen under the sun, and it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "common among men:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man to whom God hath given riches, wealth, and honour, so that he wanteth nothing for his soul of all that he desireth, yet God giveth him not power to eat thereof, but a stranger eateth it: this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity, and it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an evil disease.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If a man beget an hundred",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "children",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and live many years, so that the days of his years be many, and his soul be not filled with good, and also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he have no burial; I say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an untimely birth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than he.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he cometh in with vanity, and departeth in darkness, and his name shall be covered with darkness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover he hath not seen the sun, nor known",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any thing:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this hath more rest than the other.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Yea, though he live a thousand years twice",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "told",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", yet hath he seen no good: do not all go to one place?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the labour of man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for his mouth, and yet the appetite is not filled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For what hath the wise more than the fool? what hath the poor, that knoweth to walk before the living?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Better",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the sight of the eyes than the wandering of the desire: this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "also vanity and vexation of spirit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That which hath been is named already, and it is known that it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man: neither may he contend with him that is mightier than he.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Seeing there be many things that increase vanity, what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man the better?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For who knoweth what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good for man in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "this",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "life, all the days of his vain life which he spendeth as a shadow? for who can tell a man what shall be after him under the sun?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ECC.7",
    "number": "7",
